#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:2
msgid "Floating IPs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports sync and management of floating IP addresses for "
"OpenStack, Huawei, and OTC Clouds. When these Clouds are integrated and "
"floating IPs are present, |morpheus| will automatically sync them in. "
"Once synced, floating IPs are viewable from their own list page "
"(:menuselection:`Infrastructure --> Network --> Floating IPs`) and "
"related options are presented during provisioning, teardown, and from "
"Instance detail pages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:9
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:9
msgid ""
"The Floating IPs tab is present only when supported Clouds are integrated"
" and floating IPs are available. Additional Cloud support is planned for "
"the future."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:12
msgid "Floating IPs List Page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:14
msgid ""
"All Floating IPs known to |morpheus| can be viewed on the Floating IPs "
"List Page (:menuselection:`Infrastructure --> Network --> Floating IPs`)."
" From the Floating IPs list page we can see the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:16
msgid ""
"**IP ADDRESS**: The address for the floating IP synced from a supported "
"Cloud"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:17
msgid "**CLOUD**: The Cloud integration the floating IP was synced from"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:18
msgid ""
"**STATUS**: \"Free\" when the floating IP is available and \"Assigned\" "
"when the floating IP is currently assigned to a workload"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:19
msgid ""
"**VM**: For assigned floating IPs, the VM which currently has the "
"floating IP attached"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:21
msgid ""
"Free floating IPs will have a gear icon (|gear|) at the end of the row. "
"Click the gear icon and select \"Release Floating IP\" to release from "
"within the source cloud and remove the entry from the Floating IPs list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:23
msgid ".. image:: /images/infrastructure/network/floatIpList.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:26
msgid "Working with Floating IPs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:28
msgid ""
"When provisioning to supported Clouds, |morpheus| will give the option to"
" attach a floating IP at provision time. From the CONFIGURE tab of the "
"provisioning wizard for supported Clouds, select the desired floating IP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:30
msgid ".. image:: /images/infrastructure/network/floatIpSet.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:32
msgid ""
"During Instance teardown, |morpheus| gives the option to release the "
"floating IP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:34
msgid ".. image:: /images/infrastructure/network/floatIpDelete.png"
msgstr ""

